WEBVTT

00:00:05.310 --> 00:00:11.360
It appears that the Grandcypher crew
somehow managed to flee the garrison.

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.400
All according to plan.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:14.740
Apollo...

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:17.490
Are they on the move?

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.410
Their target is likely...

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:21.870
...the entire island.

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:27.630
So it's all according to plan
for that vixen as well, eh?

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.340
Let's go, doll.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:36.390
The Proto Reactor is active,
conversion process underway.

00:00:36.390 --> 00:00:39.600
Dark essence energy conversion
now at 40 percent.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.810
Displaying monitoring map.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.350
No anomalies detected
at any point on Golonzo Island.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.560
The Abandoned Ship is in the lower area.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:49.060
No change in its condition.

00:02:25.290 --> 00:02:28.210
Nothing's happening in town.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:30.960
And the Empire's nowhere to be found.

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:34.630
Things are quiet at the garrison, as well.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:38.970
There's been no sign that
the Empire's battleship will return.

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:43.300
Although, it doesn't seem likely that they
would retreat after such a battle.

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:49.270
As for us, we've got no way to escape.

00:02:49.270 --> 00:02:54.980
After trapping us on this island,
what have they got planned for us?

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:01.320
Noa!

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.160
I'm sorry.

00:03:03.160 --> 00:03:06.790
In my current state,
it'll take me a bit more time.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:07.830
That's enough.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:13.960
If you keep at it with your energy depleted,
you'll really disappear.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.090
Do you want Rackam's compassion
for you go to waste?

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:18.840
Sorry...

00:03:19.510 --> 00:03:21.380
Don't apologize.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.890
In any case, isn't there something we can do?

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:28.970
He's right! Noa, how can I use
my power to help you?

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:33.600
The Grandcypher brought us here.
I want to help out, too.

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.320
We've been on this journey together, after all!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:39.490
The Grandcypher's one of us now!

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:44.910
Thanks. I'm sure the Grandcypher
feels the same way, too.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.330
Noa...

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:54.420
You may be right. If your desire is strong enough,
there might still be hope.

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:03.590
By myself, it would be impossible.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:10.640
But if we can get the primal beast pactbound
to this island to help us, we just might...

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.560
You mean to say, Mithra.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.560
Is that...

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.610
The primal beast of promises, Mithra.

00:04:21.610 --> 00:04:27.950
It can force the fulfillment of any and all vows
made here on Golonzo, no matter what.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:32.120
Everyone on this island
always keep their promises,

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:35.120
whether it be a major contract or a small wish.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:40.250
To ensure that the emotions
behind the promise are never betrayed,

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:43.010
Mithra lends its power
to protect the agreement.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:47.550
So that's this island's primal beast...

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:50.100
Does that include our promise, too?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:54.230
Yes, Mithra has kept watch over it all this time.

00:04:54.850 --> 00:05:00.230
That's why I want you
to promise me again, Rackam, Gran!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:05.200
That you'll continue your journey
on the Grandcypher.

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.320
If Mithra bestows its blessing on that promise,

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:14.160
then I might regain the power
to resurrect the Grandcypher.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:17.460
In order to fulfill this renewed promise, that is.

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:22.510
It was our promise that
kept me going until now, after all.

00:05:23.670 --> 00:05:25.380
So I'm sure that it'll work once mo—

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.430
Noa?

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:35.140
What happened?

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.070
Noa?

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:43.690
Why?

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.900
I sense dark essence coming from somewhere.

00:05:46.650 --> 00:05:49.530
But that collar's off now, right? So how?!

00:05:50.200 --> 00:05:51.530
Rackam...

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:57.120
Run...

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:58.750
Noa!

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.660
Noa!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.200
Expanding the field to all of Golonzo.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.620
Linking with the Abandoned Ship,
now in berserk mode.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.750
Energy transfer system, operating normally.

00:06:45.590 --> 00:06:49.970
And now that primal beast
will exhaust all of its power...

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:53.470
Unstoppable until it vanishes completely.

00:06:54.560 --> 00:07:00.440
To keep him in berserk mode,
we shall supply him with even more energy.

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:04.730
Activate the Proto Reactor.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:09.950
What's that?

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.340
What the heck is this?

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.510
It's hard to stand...

00:07:32.890 --> 00:07:34.800
Is it because of this light?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.970
It seems to be absorbing the vitality
of everyone on the island.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:44.270
Noa didn't have enough strength left
to go berserk in his current state.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:48.280
So he's trying to make up the difference
by wringing it out of the island.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:52.860
The power is gathering around him!

00:08:01.580 --> 00:08:04.290
Who knew he was capable of this?

00:08:05.210 --> 00:08:06.290
That's right.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:11.130
This is the great battleship of the Astrals,
who once used it to invade the Sky Realm...

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:16.390
It's drawn out its architect,
the primal beast Noa, into a distorted form.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:19.640
Mithra!

00:08:20.180 --> 00:08:24.140
I swear to you that I'll save Noa,
no matter what!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:27.150
That we'll all board the Grandcypher
when it's back to normal,

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.070
and head for the Island of the Astrals!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.780
So Mithra, please help us out!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.450
Make that a promise for two, Mithra!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.580
If you're there, come on out!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:41.370
If the island goes up in smoke,
you go with it, right?

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:45.620
Please! We'll all make the same vow if we have to!

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:49.340
Hey, help Noa already! Can't you hear us?

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.260
Please answer us, Mithra!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:54.840
It's no use praying.

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.300
The promise must be made
between everyone and Noa.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:03.810
When Mithra acknowledges that promise,
and grants you its power of protection,

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:06.850
then can its powers go into effect.

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:09.860
A promise between us and Noa...

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:15.280
But will our voices reach him in that state?

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.870
If he can't hear us, we'll make him hear!
All of us, together!

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.220
The power of the dark essence
is spreading across the entire island.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:45.520
But because it's trying to absorb everything,
it's weak and unstable.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:50.480
If Noa receives Mithra's protection
and regains even a portion of his power,

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.480
then there's a chance that he'll
resist the effects of the dark essence.

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:56.320
There has to be a chance.

00:09:57.740 --> 00:10:01.830
If you want something that can take off now,
this is the best I can do.

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:04.410
That will do! I owe you one!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.580
Are you gonna be okay though?

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:09.960
I mean, just standing upright
is getting to be an ordeal for us.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:15.210
I've been to hell and back, so I'll manage.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:23.560
Everybody! This way! Over here!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:40.200
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:43.700
I've got your back,
so give him all you've got.

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.700
Make sure that our feelings reach Noa.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.210
Right!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:07.470
Noa...

00:11:15.860 --> 00:11:19.200
Noa Malice, dissolution rate, 37 percent.

00:11:19.200 --> 00:11:23.030
The energy transfer rate from the Proto Reactor
has fallen to 79 percent.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:29.040
Increase the bioenergy absorption rate
to 200 percent.

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:33.080
B-But if we do that,
the residents of Golonzo will...

00:11:34.500 --> 00:11:35.670
H-Hey!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:41.430
Raising absorption rate to maximum!

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:43.930
I'll make it right.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.110
Wh-What's this?

00:11:58.360 --> 00:11:59.440
My strength...

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:02.030
How far are they gonna go?

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:16.790
I'm losing my strength...

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.920
Noa, please stop. If you use any more power...

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:48.740
<i>The sky realm we have now is a flawed world,
built upon the corruption left by the Astrals.</i>

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:55.500
<i>I shall erase the fact that Astrals ever invaded,
and all of its history...</i>

00:12:55.500 --> 00:12:57.880
<i>restoring the true history.</i>

00:12:58.170 --> 00:13:04.180
<i>And what about the people living now?
Doesn't it matter what happens to them?</i>

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:17.940
We need to make a way through!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.940
They have to get to Noa, whatever it takes!

00:13:21.570 --> 00:13:22.400
Use this!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.170
It's open!

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:46.340
That's...

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.760
Hey, they pulled it off for us!

00:13:49.510 --> 00:13:50.510
You guys...

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:22.420
<i>Prayers gather,
and become unto icy swords...</i>

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.170
<i>To protect the eternal radiance!</i>

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:31.850
They're still coming, huh?

00:14:35.560 --> 00:14:37.350
We're on our way, Noa!

00:14:39.940 --> 00:14:42.060
Hurry, get inside!

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.240
Go!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:02.040
A lady would never yield so easily.

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.680
Are you okay?

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.600
Lyria?

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.680
Yes!

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.190
Up there...

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:23.270
He's just beyond that point.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.030
Noa...

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.330
Rackam, get to Noa.

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.200
Got it.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:56.140
Go!

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:06.360
Gran!

00:16:06.360 --> 00:16:07.190
Hurry!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:19.080
Noa! I'm coming to you!

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:28.590
Is that...

00:16:28.590 --> 00:16:29.960
I see...

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:36.300
Grandcypher...

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:39.810
You just want to protect Noa, don't you?

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.270
Of course you do.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:49.440
It's thanks to him that we're all here now.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.910
What it is that I should strive for...

00:16:57.530 --> 00:17:00.950
What it is that I'm supposed
to achieve in the skies...

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:05.120
To be honest, I still don't even know myself.

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:08.340
And yet...

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.840
My friends are getting hurt...

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:16.340
And totally innocent people
are getting caught up in all this...

00:17:17.180 --> 00:17:20.510
So many are suffering, when all they want
is to live in the skies in peace...

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.270
It's gotta stop.

00:17:24.440 --> 00:17:27.690
It can't keep going like this.

00:17:29.520 --> 00:17:31.730
I'm not giving up on this journey!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:36.990
For my own personal dream...
For everyone fighting for the future with me...

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:39.450
I'll continue on this path!

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:49.210
Lyria!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:53.670
We've come to make a promise with you!

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:56.800
Please, answer us.

00:18:01.510 --> 00:18:03.720
This time, for sure...

00:18:04.980 --> 00:18:08.190
The Grandcypher will return
to the skies once more!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:10.440
To embark into a world of freedom!

00:18:11.610 --> 00:18:13.860
And you're coming, too, Noa.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:17.700
Let me fulfill the promise I made to you that day.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.440
Mithra?

00:19:56.050 --> 00:19:57.250
Thank you.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:20:00.170
I heard them, all of them...

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.640
All your voices.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:05.140
Noa...

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:19.280
As the primal beast who commands dominion
over shipbuilding, I beseech thee...

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:23.950
To all airships, and all who were once airships...

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:26.870
Go home...
Return to where you belong!

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.430
The Grandcypher! It's back, isn't it?

00:20:54.100 --> 00:20:55.230
Thank goodness!

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.610
Noa!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:00.990
Hey! Stay with me!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:05.160
I'm completely empty now.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.320
Don't tell me you're...

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:10.660
Don't worry, I won't vanish.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:16.750
It will take some time,
but my power should be restored eventually.

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.710
Eventually?

00:21:19.250 --> 00:21:23.590
A hundred years, two hundred... maybe more?

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:32.350
Thank you for fulfilling your promise.

00:21:33.140 --> 00:21:35.440
Well, I did keep you waiting for a while.

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:39.860
The dark essence's presence has faded away.

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:41.480
And Noa is safe.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:43.240
Thank goodness.

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:44.280
Yes!

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:46.990
Let's hurry and join Katalina and the others.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:49.780
Okay! I'm sure they were worried.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.980
EPISODE 12
SIGNPOST

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:38.810
Next episode, "Signpost."
